<title>EGYPT: Egypt seeks 30,000 T US/Argentine yellow corn.</title>
<headline>Egypt seeks 30,000 T US/Argentine yellow corn.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Egyptian state's Food Industries Company said on Friday it wanted to buy 30,000 tonnes of U.S. or Argentine yellow corn.</p>
<p>The grade 2 corn would be for loading in March and delivery in either second half March or first half April, it said.</p>
<p>The deadline for bids is 11 a.m. (0900 GMT) on February 5.</p>
<p>-- Jonathan Wright +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
